  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - "Hm. That was a basic hole, according to the course specs. Let\u2019s see how
    you handle more sophisticated challenges."
  - For the sake of fairness, I will equip you with the same technology previously
    used by the Caddi.
  - Uploading the Maximally Extended Relativistic Space-Time Analysis Overlay to
    your ship now.
  - This advanced tool will allow you to track gravitational anomalies and uncover
    hidden artifacts for additional collection and analysis.
